  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide opportunities for 1000 girls out-of-school</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School of 2nd Chance is a project of professional integration through sport which aims to promote the employability and social entrepreneurship of 1.000 young Girls in NEET Situation aged between 16 and 25 years, from vulnerable neighborhoods in Morocco. The project is divided into 3 axes: 1. Work-linked training and the acquisition of technical and behavioral skills, 2. Professional experience in structures and programs of education through sport, 3. Support for access to employment.</narrative>
  </description>
